0.152	step	node tools/test_masonry_surfaces.mjs 	Early masonry uses the recorded stack disposition, preserves native triangles and leaves mapped and 1904 materials alone (T-3341)
0.338	step	node tools/test_prebuilt_index.mjs 	The page asks only for the prebuilt layers publish listed: a year with no prebuild makes no 404 request (dev mobile smoke fix)
0.157	step	node tools/check_window_mode.mjs 	Window mode sets a phone or iPad down where it stands and turns with it: the datum projection, the compass, the GPS hysteresis (T-3577)
0.064	step	node tools/test_blackbox.mjs 	The black box keeps the page's last steps in local storage, and the next page shows a cut-off page's on the crash card (T-2826)
0.649	selftest	node tools/test_parked_transport_empty_scene.mjs --self-test 	Scenes with no parked vehicles boot: update, retier and dispose without a TDZ error (T-3311); a drop to Light hands Three no empty add (T-3427)
