0.393	selftest	node tools/test_batch_shadow_cull.mjs 	Directional shadow culling retains toward-view and filter-near casters, preserves colour lists, and fails open on unknown light, camera or map state
0.163	step	node tools/test_habitat_audio.mjs 	Dated habitat audio qualifies real fauna, leaves silence and bounds voices, buffers and stale work (T-3534)
0.120	step	node tools/test_work_day_source.mjs 	1812 visible work follows real normalized primary day jobs and historical presence (T-3551)
0.074	step	node tools/test_tour_offer.mjs 	Home offers the Field Check once per device, declining or finishing never re-prompts, and the first Jaunt, Jump and Reconstructed building each hint once (T-2664)
0.077	step	node tools/test_recall.mjs 	The way home: All destinations and Recall ask first, Cancel/Esc stay put, Return runs the reverse ring and stamps the trip, reduced motion skips the ring (T-2735)
