0.056	step	node tools/test_viewport_accessibility.mjs 	Browser magnification preserves viewport size and independent movement and look controls (T-3658)
0.233	step	node tools/test_selected_year.mjs 	Selected-year arrival and catalog isolation (T-1767)
0.347	step	node tools/test_nav_sources.mjs 	Inspect's Sources tab groups every fact by grade with real counts, names each source by its own citation with no id or tier label, folds the full citation, and lists Liberties by name (T-2644)
